| 指标 | 值 |
|------|-----|
| Peak FP16 Tensor Core FLOPS | 312 TFLOPS |
| Peak HBM2e Bandwidth | 2,039 GB/s |
| Critical AI (理论) | 312,000 / 2,039 ≈ 153 FLOP/byte |
| Critical AI (实测, kernel 级) | ~12-15 FLOP/byte (effective bandwidth < peak) |

